## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0640, std = 0.1422, ICIR = 0.45, HAC t-stat = 7.6 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0773, std = 0.1422, IR = 0.54, HAC t-stat = 9.4 (lags=5)
- 注：采用 Newey–West(HAC) t-stat 以处理日度序列的自相关/异方差。

